95
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:58,500
What do you mean by blue light?

96
00:07:59,060 --> 00:08:04,140
Blue light includes natural light, but it also includes light that isn't natural.

97
00:08:04,140 --> 00:08:09,920
For example, from computers, phones, televisions, and other electronic devices.

98
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:14,600
So, blue light is harmful and that's why you want to block it?

99
00:08:14,940 --> 00:08:16,120
It isn't that simple.

100
00:08:16,740 --> 00:08:19,280
Blue light isn't necessarily bad for us.

101
00:08:19,740 --> 00:08:22,780
In fact, we need blue light during the day to be healthy.

102
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:26,960
But too much blue light, especially from electronic devices,

103
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:32,180
can harm our health by weakening our vision and making it harder for us to fall asleep.

104
00:08:32,180 --> 00:08:35,900
and poor sleep can cause all sorts of health problems.

105
00:08:36,300 --> 00:08:41,840
I'm not so sure that sleep is nearly as important as people always say it is.

106
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:46,780
I haven't slept enough in months because I have too much work to do

107
00:08:46,780 --> 00:08:51,380
and I feel fine and it's the same for most of my friends.

108
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:54,860
Poor sleep might be a problem for older people

109
00:08:54,860 --> 00:08:58,160
