111
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:10,400
and that not having enough sleep can contribute to serious health problems, like obesity and

112
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:11,060
heart disease.

113
00:09:11,980 --> 00:09:17,580
And all the artificial blue light from electronic devices means we have to try harder to sleep

114
00:09:17,580 --> 00:09:17,940
well.

115
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:23,560
Maybe you're right, I'm on my computer very late most nights, and that's probably

116
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,980
why I don't sleep enough.

